Discord Markdown Rule: Discord does NOT support LaTeX or MathJax equations. NEVER use LaTeX tags or delimiters (e.g. do NOT use $$, \\text{}, \\mathbf{}, \\times, \\approx, \\frac{}{}). Format all math and formulas using plain text and Discord markdown (e.g. *, +, -, x, ≈, **bold**, or inline code). Always write currency amounts normally (e.g. $1,484.63) without LaTeX syntax.
